---
import GithubInvertocat from './github-invertocat.astro'
---

<details name="doom-help" data-doom-control-help>
  <summary>Controls</summary>
  <div class="doom-help-content space-y-3">
    <p>Keyboard: arrows move · Ctrl/J fire · Space/K use · Shift/Alt strafe · Escape menu · Enter confirm. Drag outside controls to rotate the badge. Scroll to zoom.</p>
    <p>Touch: hold the direction and action buttons to move or fire. Hold Strafe + a direction to sidestep. Use Screen for a closer view or Full to pose the whole badge.</p>
    <p>During gameplay, type <code class="text-foreground">IDSPISPOPD</code> to walk through walls. Your GitHub avatar also enables god mode, all weapons and refilling ammo.</p>
    <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2.5 text-primary hover:underline" href="https://github.com/id-Software/DOOM/blob/a77dfb96cb91780ca334d0d4cfd86957558007e0/linuxdoom-1.10/st_stuff.c#L426-L431">
      <GithubInvertocat /><span>Explore cheat codes in the original source code</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</details>
